    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "s2_side02_0005_select_01",
      "hash64": "44CB1B8CF17EDDD7",
      "text": "我好好努力了！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "s2_side02_0005_select_02",
      "hash64": "44CB1C8CF17EDF8A",
      "text": "輕鬆搞定！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "s2_side02_0005_camera_03",
      "hash64": "46A0FB7C1A917A30",
      "text": "了不起，真了不起！\\n年輕人啊，[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳很努力喔～！[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "s2_side02_0005_camera_04",
      "hash64": "46A1027C1A918615",
      "text": "啊哈哈！輕輕鬆鬆就搞定了！？\\n厲害，不愧是寶可夢高手！酷斃了！[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "s2_side02_0005_camera_05",
      "hash64": "46A1017C1A918462",
      "text": "感覺[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳已經比我這個先來巨蛋的人\\n更熟悉這裡的寶可夢了！[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 2,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
