    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "s2_side02_0005_camera_10",
      "hash64": "469D787C1A8E65C0",
      "text": "哦～！是有名的地方嗎？\\n下次我也想去看看！[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "s2_side02_0005_camera_11",
      "hash64": "469D797C1A8E6773",
      "text": "看來不是個輕易能去的地方囉？\\n畢竟是個不得了的地方嘛～[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "s2_side02_0005_camera_12",
      "hash64": "469D7A7C1A8E6926",
      "text": "話說回來，現在這種時代，\\n照片也有可能是作假的呢。[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "s2_side02_0005_camera_13",
      "hash64": "469D7B7C1A8E6AD9",
      "text": "不過[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳要是有興趣的話，\\n去那個地方找找看神秘的寶可夢\\r\\n不也挺有趣的嗎！？[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 2,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
